  "label": "intended audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience familiar with or sensitive to racial stereotypes in healthcare, particularly those related to anti-Black racism. The target community includes individuals who may recognize the harmful implication of evaluating a Black patient's condition based on appearance rather than medical metrics, and who may be aware of systemic racism in healthcare. The meme likely appeals to those who find irony or humor in the juxtaposition of a clinical setting with racially charged stereotypes, though its intent is harmful and potentially reinforces biases. The audience may include internet users who engage with memes that play on social or racial tensions, particularly those who are aware of the 'appearance-based evaluation' stereotype and its implications in medical contexts.",
